ABOUT THIS PROJECT

Vanilla Appliances Extended adds two craftable appliances, a chest freezer and a
potbelly stove, both styled and balanced to sit alongside the base game's own.

The original stopped working when build 42 landed and its author is no longer
updating it. This project continues it against the current build, and drops
pre-42 support entirely rather than trying to straddle both.


